  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate thin-film lithium niobate modulators on 200-mm wafers in a back-end-of-line CMOS foundry. We achieve O-band propagation loss of &lt;0.5 dB/cm and TFLN modulators with 110 GHz bandwidth and 1.9 V\u00b7cm modulation efficiency.</jats:p>",
